"^orange;Lady Bastet^reset;, beloved of the Gods,
I call to you, mighty lady of the East,
right eye of ^orange;Ra^reset;.

Thank you for your ^green;healing^reset;, your ^green;protection^reset;, and your ^green;strength^reset;.
I find ^cyan;joy^reset; in your presence and ^cyan;humor^reset; in your playfulness.
I revere your ^orange;fiery soul^reset;, your ^red;passion^reset;, and your ^#ffaaaa;sensuality^reset;.
Thank you for working with me,
and thank you for choosing me to become a part of you.

^orange;I honor you^reset;."
